cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived software release and the associated protocol article when available."
title: "Multiplex Immunofluorescence and Chromogenic IHC Analysis Suite"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-02
authors:
  - given-names: "Arun (Geetha)"
    family-names: "Viswanathan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/arunviswanathan91/ImageAnalysis"
url: "https://github.com/arunviswanathan91/ImageAnalysis"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An interactive Google Colab notebook for cell-based quantitative analysis
  of multiplex immunofluorescence images and cell-based or area-based analysis
  of chromogenic immunohistochemistry images. The workflow includes image
  import, channel assignment, segmentation, optical-density or intensity
  measurement, threshold review, visualization, and export.
keywords:
  - bioimage analysis
  - digital pathology
  - immunohistochemistry
  - multiplex immunofluorescence
  - H-score
  - Cellpose
  - Google Colab

